-Sessions never expire.
+Sessions expire `SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds) after they are saved. A saved
+session is stamped with an `issued_at` timestamp, and restoring a session
+older than the TTL raises an error. Expired entries are also purged from the
+on-disk cache (via `purge_expired()`) each time a session is restored.
